# Versioning Format

Use the `yy.mm.ddbx` format for all versions going forward where `bx` iterates every prompt sent each day.
Each new day is based off of the local date in Denver, CO (Mountain Time).

Example: `26.09.13b2` (for 2026, September 13th, 2nd prompt of the day).
